  m_Text: 'Legend ::   <color="#fc4103"><b>[Critical Stimuli Square]</b></color>    |   <color="#cccccc"><b>[Physical
    Screen]</b></color>    |   <color="#fcba03"><b>[Camera Viewport]</b></color>


    The lab which has the setup with the <b>smallest</b> visual angle is the <b>reference</b>
    lab,

    and tweaks the config (visual angles of various elements) and base zoom (1st slider)
    to get the desired visual result.


    Every other lab uses <b>the same config & base zoom</b> as the reference lab,

    and sets the <b>lab zoom</b> (2nd slider) to the ratio of the reference lab''s
    setup''s visual angle w.r.t. their own.


    When you''re done, click the "Update" button to save your changes. "Back" returns
    you to the main screen.'
